# build output (careful: host/src/bin/ is SOURCE - d3inject - so no bare "bin/" pattern)
target/
**/bin/Debug/
**/bin/Release/
**/bin/aot/
**/obj/
/tools/D3ModTool/out/
/dist/
*.user
.vs/

# built example plugins (sources are tracked; the DLLs are build output)
/examples/*/client-code/
/examples/*/server/

# logs and local settings
*.log
appsettings.Local.json
